   array['Coast of Rio Grande do Sul', 'Minas Gerais', 'The Amazon', 'The Northeastern backlands'],
   'Brazilian Baroque had major expression in Minas Gerais, a region linked to the gold cycle.'),
  ('402d077a-5842-5131-80de-dd97a1ed7ae0', 'es',
