   array['Litoral de Rio Grande do Sul', 'Minas Gerais', 'La Amazonía', 'El sertón nororiental'],
   'El Barroco brasileño tuvo gran expresión en Minas Gerais, región ligada al ciclo del oro.'),
  ('1b70cad1-a4b9-5ff5-a1ab-7a22ff7c2d73', 'en',
   'Aleijadinho, an important artist of Brazilian Baroque, was mainly known in which area?',
   array['Popular music', 'Cinema', 'Sculpture and religious architecture', 'Photography'],
   'Aleijadinho was known for sculpture and religious architecture in the Baroque of Minas Gerais.'),
  ('1b70cad1-a4b9-5ff5-a1ab-7a22ff7c2d73', 'es',
   'Aleijadinho, importante artista del Barroco brasileño, se destacó principalmente en qué área?',
   array['Música popular', 'Cine', 'Escultura y arquitectura religiosa', 'Fotografía'],
   'Aleijadinho se destacó en la escultura y la arquitectura religiosa del Barroco de Minas Gerais.'),
  ('131d7fc7-99b4-5035-89e3-e3ad8cfafb9d', 'en',
   'What characterizes Baroque painting in terms of light and shadow?',
   array['Total absence of contrast', 'Exclusive use of pastel colors', 'Flat and uniform lighting', 'Strong contrast between light and shadow (chiaroscuro), creating drama'],
   'Baroque painting uses strong contrast between light and shadow (chiaroscuro) to create drama.'),
  ('131d7fc7-99b4-5035-89e3-e3ad8cfafb9d', 'es',
   '¿Qué caracteriza a la pintura barroca en términos de luz y sombra?',
   array['Ausencia total de contraste', 'Uso exclusivo de colores pastel', 'Iluminación plana y uniforme', 'Fuerte contraste entre luz y sombra (claroscuro), creando dramatismo'],
   'La pintura barroca usa un fuerte contraste entre luz y sombra (claroscuro) para crear dramatismo.'),
  ('e3b3b274-b25f-52e8-ac97-e663f0eb592e', 'en',
   'What is a typical architectural characteristic of Baroque churches?',
   array['Ornamented, curved façades and richly decorated interiors', 'Completely flat façades with no ornaments', 'Complete absence of religious elements', 'Structures made exclusively of glass and steel'],
   'Baroque churches usually have ornamented, curved façades and richly decorated interiors.'),
  ('e3b3b274-b25f-52e8-ac97-e663f0eb592e', 'es',
   '¿Cuál es una característica arquitectónica típica de las iglesias barrocas?',
   array['Fachadas ornamentadas, curvas e interiores ricamente decorados', 'Fachadas totalmente lisas y sin ornamentos', 'Ausencia completa de elementos religiosos', 'Estructuras exclusivamente de vidrio y acero'],
   'Las iglesias barrocas suelen tener fachadas ornamentadas, curvas e interiores ricamente decorados.'),
  ('f6c8bbc7-97f6-5c81-af4d-cbf35146a76b', 'en',
   'Brazilian Baroque is historically associated with which socioeconomic context?',
   array['Cattle-ranching economy in the South', 'The mining economy and the Catholic Church in the colonial period', 'The rubber extraction economy', '20th-century industrialization'],
   'Brazilian Baroque is historically linked to the mining economy and the Catholic Church in the colonial period.'),
  ('f6c8bbc7-97f6-5c81-af4d-cbf35146a76b', 'es',
