   array['Brazilian Baroque', 'Renaissance', 'Brazilian Modernism', 'European Impressionism'],
   'The 1922 Modern Art Week is considered the founding landmark of Brazilian Modernism.'),
  ('06fd70c7-6985-5c40-ba79-a1e0c17ac65d', 'es',
