   array['The complete rejection of any foreign influence', '"Devouring" foreign references and reworking them in an original, Brazilian way', 'The exact copying of European works', 'The end of all national artistic production'],
   'The Anthropophagic Movement proposed "devouring" foreign references and reworking them in an original, Brazilian way.'),
