   array['Diversity of languages, materials and themes, including installations and performances', 'Exclusive use of Renaissance techniques', 'Total absence of social criticism', 'Restriction to a single fixed style'],
   'Brazilian contemporary art is characterized by a diversity of languages, materials and themes.'),
