   array['Only traditional academic painting', 'The relationship between body, color and space in participatory works', 'Exclusively classical marble sculptures', 'Only realistic portraits'],
   'Hélio Oiticica is known for exploring the relationship between body, color and space in participatory works.'),
  ('21ee3c2d-8d9d-50d0-850a-32837b415e80', 'es',
