   array['Solo pintura académica tradicional', 'La relación entre cuerpo, color y espacio en obras participativas', 'Exclusivamente esculturas de mármol clásico', 'Solo retratos realistas'],
   'Hélio Oiticica es conocido por explorar la relación entre cuerpo, color y espacio en obras participativas.'),
  ('c6888b35-7f7e-526b-8018-fbeaf7da5ec2', 'en',
   'Lygia Clark, a Brazilian artist linked to Neo-Concretism, is known for works that:',
   array['Must be viewed only from a distance, without contact', 'Are made exclusively of stone', 'Invite the viewer to physically interact with the work', 'Realistically depict landscapes'],
   'Lygia Clark is known for works that invite the viewer to physically interact with them.'),
