   array['Deben observarse solo a distancia, sin contacto', 'Están hechas exclusivamente de piedra', 'Invitan al espectador a interactuar físicamente con la obra', 'Retratan paisajes de forma realista'],
   'Lygia Clark es conocida por obras que invitan al espectador a interactuar físicamente con ellas.'),
  ('fe972ba3-8cc9-5cc0-a921-c08dcd0925c7', 'en',
   'Graffiti, present in many Brazilian cities, is today recognized by part of the critics as:',
   array['An exclusively illegal language with no artistic value', 'A practice restricted to museums', 'A technique extinct since the 19th century', 'A legitimate form of contemporary urban art'],
   'Graffiti is today recognized by part of the critics as a legitimate form of contemporary urban art.'),
  ('fe972ba3-8cc9-5cc0-a921-c08dcd0925c7', 'es',
