   array['Sounds from different sources (instruments or voices), even playing the same note', 'Only the duration of a note', 'Only the volume of a piece of music', 'Only the tempo of a piece'],
   'Timbre allows us to distinguish sounds from different sources, even when playing the same note.'),
  ('3204c586-5135-591b-b793-ab1027aefae3', 'es',
