   array['The composer''s name', 'Variations in volume/sound intensity throughout a piece', 'The exclusively used instrument', 'The total duration of the work'],
   'Dynamics refers to variations in volume/sound intensity throughout a piece.'),
  ('cb3ce9d0-730a-543a-865e-d810ceeb6503', 'es',
